      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788972346450,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.  Cors Error \n2. context api \n3. frontned and backend integration\n4. to avoid cors error we have run\nboth frontend and backend on the\nsame server via vite developemnt ser\nve \n5. frontend api request  ---\n> Vite Developement Server   -->\nBackend Server   and vise versa\nwhen the backend repond sent to th\ne vite dev. server and it sent to th\ne frontend ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.  Cors Error \n2. context api \n3. frontned and backend integration\n4. to avoid cors error we have run both frontend and backend on the same server via vite developemnt ser ve \n5. frontend api request  ---\n> Vite Developement Server   --> Backend Server   and vise versa when the backend repond sent to th e vite dev. server and it sent to th e frontend ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
